  "description": "Jung Dong-Woo, famously known as \"Another\" in the game world, meets a player named \"Honey Milk Tea\" online. Over time, he develops a crush on her and decides to ask her out at the players' meetup - but when Su-Jin walks in, Dong-Woo realizes that his beloved Honey Milk Tea is actually a man. Disappointed and embarrassed, Dong-Woo starts chugging one drink after another, and it all goes south from there... \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
